  "newCodeRationale": "Reuse core CitationRef, SpanAssembler, PolicyChecks, PdoUsages, PdoCatalogTransaction and PdoDependencyStore. Add only the missing immutable citation writer/resolver and controlled bounded reading gateway; existing SQL tables and wire schemas remain unchanged.",
  "sourceGaps": [
    "Pinned donors do not implement tenant/KB/source shared SQL guards, immutable resolver rows, atomic Usage lineage, DB-clock freshness or ambiguous-COMMIT handling. These use the qualified core disclosure implementation.",
    "Arbitrary PDF/image rendering and dynamic crops are not supplied by these PHP donors. Region reads return only an exact retained IR asset with its original bbox/transform and produced-byte digest; unmatched regions refuse, ambiguous regions return alternatives.",
    "No optional external BlobStore adapter or HTTP/Laravel delivery adapter is claimed implemented. The gateway returns a bounded buffer for authenticated host delivery; originals above the hard bound refuse."
